{"step_index":5641,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-23T19:44:02Z","thinking":"Initial inspection of the code reveals a function designed to extract strength values from text, attempting to handle various unit abbreviations. The presence of similar Arabic abbreviations (`مجم` vs. `جم`) suggests a need to differentiate them correctly during parsing. Code appears to attempt to normalize numbers and then perform regular expression matching to isolate numerical values and associated units.\n\n\nExamined the added function to determine if medication forms are identical, considering tablets and capsules as equivalent.  Revised the classification logic to categorize matches based on brand, strength, and form compatibility, flagging form differences as \"review\" and conflicts as \"reject.\" The new logic classifies ambiguous cases based on similarity thresholds.\n\n\nThe code first checks for exact matches in a pre-normalized warehouse item list; then, it classifies based on a similarity check. If an exact match is found, the shortage and warehouse items are added to the matched list.  If not, it searches for top candidates using a fuzzy search.  Candidate items are then classified as either matches, requiring review, or ambiguous.\n\n\nAmbiguous cases are identified; these require further analysis.  The top candidates for ambiguous items are formatted for an external tool to determine the correct matches.  Items flagged for review based on form differences are added to a separate list with specific rationale.\n\n\nNow checking the strength matching logic.  It appears the code retrieves strength values from both the shortage item and the warehouse item. If both have strength values, a comparison occurs. The attempt is to convert the values to floats for an exact numerical comparison.\n\nIf a float conversion fails, it defaults to a string comparison. If the strength values do not match, the status becomes \"no_match\".  This ensures strength values are considered when determining a match or review.\n\n\nExamining the multi-strength slash matching; the code uses regular expressions to isolate values like \"X/Y\". If one item has such a value and the other doesn't, or if the values differ, the match status is set to \"no_match.\"\n\nThe presence or absence of \"co\" (combination) is checked.  If the combination status differs between items, it also results in a \"no_match\" status.\n\nIf the initial match is positive (\"match\"), a form check is initiated; form extraction and comparison follow.  Differences in forms, or drops/syrup type, trigger a \"review\" status.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Update get_strength_pattern and add classify_pair in coordinator.py","EndLine":195,"Instruction":"Add are_forms_identical and classify_pair, and fix unit check in get_strength_pattern","ReplacementContent":"def get_strength_pattern(text: str) -> str | None:\n    text = norm_num(text.lower())\n    m = re.search(r'(\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)?)\\s*(مجم|مج|جم|جرام|gm|mg|mcg|مكجم)', text)\n    if m:\n        val = m.group(1)\n        unit = m.group(2)\n        if unit in ['جم', 'جرام', 'gm']:\n            try:\n                val = str(float(val) * 1000)\n            except:\n                pass\n        return val\n    m2 = re.search(r'\\b(1000|875|625|500|400|300|250|200|150|125|100|80|75|50|40|25|20|15|10|5|2.5|1)\\b', text)\n    if m2:\n        return m2.group(1)\n    if 'ربع' in text or '25.' in text:\n        return '0.25'\n    if 'نص' in text or 'نصف' in text or '.5' in text or '0.5' in text:\n        return '0.5'\n    return None\n\ndef has_co(text: str) -> bool:\n    t = text.lower()\n    return bool(re.search(r'(?:^|[^\\w])(كو|بلس|بلاس|كومب|co|plus|comp)(?:[^\\w]|$)|كواقراص|كوأقراص|بلساقراص|بلسكبسول', t))\n\ndef are_forms_identical(form1: str | None, form2: str | None) -> bool:\n    if not form1 or not form2:\n        return True\n    if form1 == form2:\n        return True\n    if (form1, form2) in {('tablet', 'capsule'), ('capsule', 'tablet')}:\n        return True\n    return False\n\ndef are_forms_compatible(form1: str | None, form2: str | None) -> bool:\n    if not form1 and not form2:\n        return True\n    if form1 == form2:\n        return True\n    compat = {\n        ('tablet', 'capsule'), ('capsule', 'tablet'),\n        ('cream', 'ointment'), ('ointment', 'cream'),\n        ('cream', 'gel'), ('gel', 'cream'),\n        ('injection', 'ampoule'), ('ampoule', 'injection'),\n    }\n    if (form1, form2) in compat:\n        return True\n    if form1 and form2 and form1 != form2:\n        return False\n    return True\n\nBRAND_FAMILIES = {'بيتادين', 'هيرو', 'انسولين', 'ليمتلس', 'سيتال', 'لبن'}\n\ndef classify_pair(req: str, cand: str) -> tuple[str, str]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Classifies a (requested, candidate) pair according to the user's pharmaceutical algorithm:\n    - 'match': Same brand, same strength, identical/compatible form.\n    - 'review': Same brand, same strength, but DIFFERENT form (e.g. cream vs ointment, drops vs tablet).\n    - 'reject': Different strength (التركيز خط أحمر), or different combination, or brand family conflict.\n    - 'ambiguous': Brand similarity 60%-85% (OCR typos like برونفين vs بروفين) -> send to LLM.\n    \"\"\"\n    brand_r = extract_brand_tokens(req)\n    brand_c = extract_brand_tokens(cand)\n    if not brand_r or not brand_c:\n        return \"reject\", \"no_brand\"\n        \n    words_r = brand_r.split()\n    words_c = brand_c.split()\n    first_r = words_r[0] if words_r else \"\"\n    first_c = words_c[0] if words_c else \"\"\n    \n    # 1. Brand Family Protection\n    if first_r in BRAND_FAMILIES or first_c in BRAND_FAMILIES:\n        if fuzz.ratio(brand_r, brand_c) < 85:\n            return \"reject\", \"brand_family_conflict\"\n            \n    # 2. Combination check (كو / بلس)\n    if has_co(req) != has_co(cand):\n        return \"reject\", \"combination_mismatch\"\n        \n    # 3. Strength check (التركيز خط أحمر - zero tolerance)\n    str_r = get_strength_pattern(req)\n    str_c = get_strength_pattern(cand)\n    if str_r and str_c:\n        try:\n            if float(str_r) != float(str_c):\n                return \"reject\", f\"strength_conflict_{str_r}_vs_{str_c}\"\n        except:\n            if str_r != str_c:\n                return \"reject\", f\"strength_conflict_{str_r}_vs_{str_c}\"\n                \n    slash_r = re.search(r'(?:^|[^\\d/])(\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)?\\/\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)?)(?:[^\\d/]|$)', norm_num(req))\n    slash_c = re.search(r'(?:^|[^\\d/])(\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)?\\/\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)?)(?:[^\\d/]|$)', norm_num(cand))\n    if slash_r and slash_c and slash_r.group(1) != slash_c.group(1):\n        return \"reject\", \"slash_strength_conflict\"\n    if (slash_r and not slash_c) or (slash_c and not slash_r):\n        return \"reject\", \"slash_missing_conflict\"\n\n    # 4. Brand Similarity & Identity\n    b_sim = fuzz.ratio(brand_r, brand_c)\n    is_exact_brand = (brand_r == brand_c)\n    \n    if len(words_r) == 1 and len(words_c) == 1:\n        if first_r == first_c:\n            is_exact_brand = True\n        elif fuzz.ratio(first_r, first_c) >= 90:\n            is_exact_brand = True\n            \n    if len(words_r) == len(words_c) and len(words_r) > 1:\n        words_match = all(w_r == w_c or fuzz.ratio(w_r, w_c) >= 85 for w_r, w_c in zip(words_r, words_c))\n        if words_match:\n            is_exact_brand = True\n            \n    if not is_exact_brand:\n        if b_sim >= 60:\n            return \"ambiguous\", f\"ocr_check_needed_{b_sim}%\"\n        else:\n            return \"reject\", f\"low_brand_sim_{b_sim}%\"\n\n    # 5. Form check for confirmed brand:\n    form_r = extract_form_group(req)\n    form_c = extract_form_group(cand)\n    \n    is_r_drops = 'نقط' in req or 'قطره' in req or 'قطرة' in req\n    is_c_drops = 'نقط' in cand or 'قطره' in cand or 'قطرة' in cand\n    is_drops_conflict = (is_r_drops != is_c_drops)\n    \n    is_req_syrup = bool(re.search(r'\\b(شراب|شرب|معلق)\\b', req))\n    is_cand_syrup = bool(re.search(r'\\b(شراب|شرب|معلق)\\b', cand))\n    is_syrup_conflict = (is_req_syrup != is_cand_syrup)\n    \n    if are_forms_identical(form_r, form_c) and not is_drops_conflict and not is_syrup_conflict:\n        return \"match\", \"exact_brand_and_form\"\n    else:\n        return \"review\", f\"different_form_{form_r}_vs_{form_c}\"\n\ndef is_safe_auto_match(req: str, cand: str) -> tuple[bool, str]:\n    status, reason = classify_pair(req, cand)\n    return (status == \"match\", reason)","StartLine":100,"TargetContent":"def get_strength_pattern(text: str) -> str | None:\n    text = norm_num(text.lower())\n    m = re.search(r'(\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)?)\\s*(?:مجم|مج|جم|جرام|gm|mg|mcg|مكجم)', text)\n    if m:\n        val = m.group(1)\n        if any(unit in m.group(0) for unit in ['جم', 'جرام', 'gm']):\n            try:\n                val = str(float(val) * 1000)\n            except:\n                pass\n        return val\n    m2 = re.search(r'\\b(1000|875|625|500|400|300|250|200|150|125|100|80|75|50|40|25|20|15|10|5|2.5|1)\\b', text)\n    if m2:\n        return m2.group(1)\n    if 'ربع' in text or '25.' in text:\n        return '0.25'\n    if 'نص' in text or 'نصف' in text or '.5' in text or '0.5' in text:\n        return '0.5'\n    return None\n\ndef has_co(text: str) -> bool:\n    t = text.lower()\n    return bool(re.search(r'(?:^|[^\\w])(كو|بلس|بلاس|كومب|co|plus|comp)(?:[^\\w]|$)|كواقراص|كوأقراص|بلساقراص|بلسكبسول', t))\n\ndef are_forms_compatible(form1: str | None, form2: str | None) -> bool:\n    if not form1 and not form2:\n        return True\n    if form1 == form2:\n        return True\n    compat = {\n        ('tablet', 'capsule'), ('capsule', 'tablet'),\n        ('cream', 'ointment'), ('ointment', 'cream'),\n        ('cream', 'gel'), ('gel', 'cream'),\n        ('injection', 'ampoule'), ('ampoule', 'injection'),\n    }\n    if (form1, form2) in compat:\n        return True\n    if form1 and form2 and form1 != form2:\n        return False\n    return True\n\nBRAND_FAMILIES = {'بيتادين', 'هيرو', 'انسولين', 'ليمتلس', 'سيتال', 'لبن'}\n\ndef is_safe_auto_match(req: str, cand: str) -> tuple[bool, str]:\n    brand_r = extract_brand_tokens(req)\n    brand_c = extract_brand_tokens(cand)\n    if not brand_r or not brand_c:\n        return False, \"no_brand\"\n        \n    words_r = brand_r.split()\n    words_c = brand_c.split()\n    \n    first_r = words_r[0]\n    first_c = words_c[0]\n    if first_r in BRAND_FAMILIES or first_c in BRAND_FAMILIES:\n        if fuzz.ratio(brand_r, brand_c) < 85:\n            return False, \"brand_family_ambiguity\"\n            \n    if len(words_r) == 1 and len(words_c) == 1:\n        if first_r != first_c and fuzz.ratio(first_r, first_c) < 90:\n            return False, f\"brand_diff_{first_r}_vs_{first_c}\"\n    elif len(words_r) == len(words_c):\n        for w_r, w_c in zip(words_r, words_c):\n            if w_r != w_c and fuzz.ratio(w_r, w_c) < 85:\n                return False, f\"brand_word_diff_{w_r}_vs_{w_c}\"\n    else:\n        if fuzz.ratio(brand_r, brand_c) < 85:\n            return False, \"low_brand_sim\"\n            \n    form_r = extract_form_group(req)\n    form_c = extract_form_group(cand)\n    if not are_forms_compatible(form_r, form_c):\n        return False, \"form_conflict\"\n        \n    is_r_drops = 'نقط' in req or 'قطره' in req or 'قطرة' in req\n    is_c_drops = 'نقط' in cand or 'قطره' in cand or 'قطرة' in cand\n    if is_r_drops != is_c_drops:\n        return False, \"drops_conflict\"\n        \n    is_req_syrup = bool(re.search(r'\\b(شراب|شرب|معلق)\\b', req))\n    is_cand_syrup = bool(re.search(r'\\b(شراب|شرب|معلق)\\b', cand))\n    norm_c = norm_num(cand)\n    norm_r = norm_num(req)\n    has_c_solid_mg = bool(re.search(r'\\b(100|125|200|250|300|400|500|600|800|1000)\\s*(?:مجم|مج|mg)\\b', norm_c)) and not re.search(r'\\b(مل|ملل|ml|/5|5مل)\\b', norm_c)\n    has_r_solid_mg = bool(re.search(r'\\b(100|125|200|250|300|400|500|600|800|1000)\\s*(?:مجم|مج|mg)\\b', norm_r)) and not re.search(r'\\b(مل|ملل|ml|/5|5مل)\\b', norm_r)\n    if (is_req_syrup and not is_cand_syrup and has_c_solid_mg) or (is_cand_syrup and not is_req_syrup and has_r_solid_mg):\n        return False, \"syrup_solid_conflict\"\n        \n    if has_co(req) != has_co(cand):\n        return False, \"co_mismatch\"\n        \n    str_r = get_strength_pattern(req)\n    str_c = get_strength_pattern(cand)\n    if str_r and str_c:\n        try:\n            if float(str_r) != float(str_c):\n                return False, f\"strength_mismatch_{str_r}_vs_{str_c}\"\n        except:\n            if str_r != str_c:\n                return False, f\"strength_mismatch_{str_r}_vs_{str_c}\"\n                \n    slash_r = re.search(r'(?:^|[^\\d/])(\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)?\\/\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)?)(?:[^\\d/]|$)', norm_num(req))\n    slash_c = re.search(r'(?:^|[^\\d/])(\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)?\\/\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)?)(?:[^\\d/]|$)', norm_num(cand))\n    if (slash_r and not slash_c) or (slash_c and not slash_r):\n        return False, \"slash_strength_mismatch\"\n    if slash_r and slash_c and slash_r.group(1) != slash_c.group(1):\n        return False, \"slash_strength_mismatch\"\n        \n    return True, \"auto_matched\"","TargetFile":"d:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy\\src\\fast_match\\coordinator.py","toolAction":"Update classifier in coordinator.py","toolSummary":"Replace classification logic in coordinator"}}]}
